# Artisanal Human-Art UI/UX & Framer Craft Directives

## Source of Truth & Architecture
- Component Vault: https://github.com/JishnuPG-tech/framer-components-vault (1,683+ primitives)
- Live API: https://jishnupg-opencode-cli.hf.space/preview/3000/api
- Integrated Systems: Anti-Slop Core Filter, Refero Taste Evidence, Radix UI Headless A11y, shadcn Semantic Tokens, Iconsax 24x24 SVGs.

## AI Reward Engine (Strict Negative Rewarding)
- Disqualifications (-1000 pts): Contrast < 4.5:1, touch target < 44x44px, missing focus-visible ring, linear 0.3s ease / 0ms instant snaps.
- Heavy Penalties (-100 to -50 pts): Generic purple/blue AI glow, sterile default void, copy-paste 3-card templates, raw hex colors in components, excessive glassmorphism everywhere, uniform pill radius.
- Positive Rewards (+90 to +50 pts): Radix headless a11y, Framer Motion springs, negative tracking typographic clamp, obsidian glass depth, Iconsax 24px SVG consistency.
- Passing Score: Net >= +200 pts.

## Kinetic Laws
- Snappy: { type: "spring", stiffness: 320, damping: 28, mass: 0.8, restDelta: 0.001 }
- Fluid: { type: "spring", stiffness: 260, damping: 34, mass: 1.0, restDelta: 0.01 }
- Editorial: { type: "spring", stiffness: 140, damping: 22, mass: 1.2, restDelta: 0.01 }
- Magnetic: { type: "spring", stiffness: 400, damping: 30, mass: 0.5, restDelta: 0.001 }

## Typographic Tension & Surfaces
- Large headings (>32px): negative tracking (-0.04em to -0.055em), tight line-height (1.05em to 1.15em), clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem).
- Micro-labels: uppercase monospace (11px, letter-spacing: 0.12em).
- Surfaces: Liquid obsidian glass (backdrop-blur, border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08), box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15)).
- Headless Visual Inspection: Inspect live UI via computed styles, bounding client rects, and CDP accessibility tree without screenshots.
